          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s2042",
            "repere": "Texte · SAVED my TempurPedic Mattress!",
            "text": "SAVED my TempurPedic Mattress!",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s2044",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · Bought this protector after extensive re",
            "text": "Bought this protector after extensive research. Wanted a protector that would not inhibit the cooling properties of the Tempurpedic LuxeBreeze mattress we purchased and waited 2 months for it to be delivered. This one seemed to fit the bill and met all of my criteria. It was easy to install and feels soft to the touch with none of the plasticky feel of average protectors. I was skeptical that it would provide adequate protection since our 4yo has been co-sleeping with us of late.",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s2045",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · Last night, it finally happened…My 4yo w",
            "text": "Last night, it finally happened…My 4yo wet the bed in spectacular fashion, saturating the sheets, the blanket, and the protector. I was sure my $$$$$ mattress was TOAST but to my surprise, not a drop made it through to the mattress!",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s2046",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · I’m thinking of buying another one to “d",
            "text": "I’m thinking of buying another one to “double bag” it for peace of mind, to be honest. But this protector has already saved us from a very costly disaster!",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
